WEBVTT

00:02.256 --> 00:04.464
What now?

00:05.353 --> 00:08.873
He may be connected to the d'Alembert family…

00:09.288 --> 00:10.872
But he's a wanted man.

00:11.472 --> 00:14.336
I wouldn't get on anyone's
bad side if I killed him.

00:15.472 --> 00:18.896
And once he's out of the picture…

00:23.072 --> 00:25.744
That man is mine.

00:32.640 --> 00:34.432
You have ten seconds to get lost.

00:35.040 --> 00:36.224
Otherwise…

00:37.296 --> 00:38.224
You're dead.

00:38.752 --> 00:42.304
Ten. Nine. Eight. Seven.

00:42.576 --> 00:43.472
- Six.
- Koga!

00:43.472 --> 00:45.296
How long are you going to sleep?!

00:45.296 --> 00:46.796
Run away!

00:46.864 --> 00:48.288
What an idiot.

00:49.265 --> 00:55.024
A man like you is perfectly capable of
killing his master and freeing himself.

00:56.880 --> 00:59.696
But I don't want a starved dog.

01:00.400 --> 01:01.904
I want a ferocious wolf.

01:03.169 --> 01:05.073
I'm disappointed in you.

02:37.792 --> 02:38.880
Heya!

02:38.880 --> 02:40.160
Over here!

02:40.832 --> 02:43.136
Lycia? Why are you…

02:44.128 --> 02:45.600
Thanks for the food!

02:46.272 --> 02:48.032
I never said I'm paying.

02:48.304 --> 02:50.272
Aw, you're so greedy!

02:50.656 --> 02:54.144
You're not even going to apologize
for ditching your date?

02:54.752 --> 02:56.480
Noel, you took too long.

02:57.408 --> 03:01.760
I would have been eating
all on my lonesome if not for Lycia.

03:03.424 --> 03:05.488
Fine. I'll treat you.

03:05.936 --> 03:07.472
But just this once.

03:07.936 --> 03:09.024
Yay!

03:10.992 --> 03:12.272
By the way, Noel…

03:12.720 --> 03:14.992
Did you recruit any ambitious rookies?

03:15.504 --> 03:15.872
Huh?

03:16.192 --> 03:21.120
You took so long to get back,
I figured you were out headhunting.

03:21.664 --> 03:22.560
Were you?

03:28.656 --> 03:29.776
No, not at all.

03:30.265 --> 03:33.280
I couldn't find anyone I wanted.

03:34.192 --> 03:36.480
I slipped away for another reason.

03:36.864 --> 03:38.192
What was it?

03:39.616 --> 03:43.824
Have you heard that there's
a dangerous drug going around?

03:44.288 --> 03:46.608
Oh, I think I have.

03:46.608 --> 03:48.016
What about it?

03:48.400 --> 03:51.712
Apparently it's powerful,
but causes uncontrollable rage as a side effect.

03:52.624 --> 03:55.200
Wow. That's pretty scary, huh?

03:55.568 --> 03:58.912
Yeah. And apparently it's going unchecked.

03:59.264 --> 04:01.888
Tell Wolf to watch out for it too.

04:04.128 --> 04:04.704
What's wrong?

04:05.248 --> 04:10.480
It's just not like you
to be concerned for us, Noel.

04:11.280 --> 04:15.232
I'm not concerned. Just sharing info
as a partner in business.

04:15.744 --> 04:17.440
Okay, if you say so.

04:18.176 --> 04:20.736
It's about time to get to work,
so I'll be going now.

04:21.088 --> 04:22.368
Thanks for the food, Noel.

04:23.072 --> 04:23.552
Yep.

04:23.792 --> 04:25.872
Let's get together again, Alma.

04:25.966 --> 04:28.496
I know a cafe with really good sweets.

04:28.583 --> 04:30.496
I'll take you next time!

04:31.344 --> 04:32.114
Really?

04:32.208 --> 04:33.712
Yeah, let's hang out!

04:34.064 --> 04:37.664
Not as business partners… but as friends.

04:39.168 --> 04:40.224
Friends…

04:40.288 --> 04:41.840
Is that too much?

04:42.943 --> 04:45.568
I don't mind. Let's be BFFs!

04:46.080 --> 04:48.336
Ooh, BFFs! I like that!

04:48.650 --> 04:51.632
- You too, Noel…
- Go. You'll be late.

04:56.048 --> 04:59.920
If even Lycia has heard gossip about this drug…

05:00.528 --> 05:05.600
It must be spreading
outside the Gambinos' territory.

05:06.320 --> 05:08.384
Hopefully it doesn't become a larger issue.

05:10.161 --> 05:12.960
I'm in hot water now…

05:13.248 --> 05:15.232
You've been very naughty, Miguel.

05:15.232 --> 05:17.632
Running off with the family's money.

05:18.160 --> 05:20.144
I can't let you get away with that.

05:20.768 --> 05:24.352
Did you think you could lose us
by running to the capital?

05:25.216 --> 05:27.312
This is a wanted poster from the d'Alemberts.

05:27.312 --> 05:32.496
Papa Luciano instructed us to
hand you over immediately if found.

05:32.800 --> 05:36.976
This is the last man I wanted to catch me.

05:37.712 --> 05:42.320
Albert Gambino. The true madman,
the devil himself.

05:42.784 --> 05:45.584
Some call him a living calamity.

05:46.240 --> 05:53.856
It seems the Gambino family
has successfully captured the traitor.

05:53.856 --> 05:58.096
But frankly, it wouldn't be much fun
to simply hand you over.

05:59.024 --> 06:00.672
What do you mean by that?

06:01.152 --> 06:08.592
Why should we work for a mere countryside family
like the d'Alemberts, after all?

06:08.899 --> 06:11.920
Y-You're exactly right!

06:12.016 --> 06:16.251
The most highly respected member of the Lucianos

06:16.252 --> 06:20.976
mustn't bow to the likes
of the d'Alemberts, indeed!

06:21.296 --> 06:26.304
You see what I'm getting at.
I'm too good for that.

06:26.688 --> 06:30.673
R-Really? In that case, I'd be honored…

06:30.736 --> 06:31.952
I have a better idea.

06:33.232 --> 06:36.800
I'll hand you and your slave over as stuffed toys.

06:37.376 --> 06:40.768
S… Stuffed… toys?

06:41.328 --> 06:48.080
Yes. I'll have you skinned alive,
process you into ham and sausages,

06:48.081 --> 06:50.272
and send you to the d'Alemberts as a set.

06:50.272 --> 06:53.824
That'll really surprise them! What fun!

06:53.824 --> 06:57.504
Don't you agree it's a wonderful idea, Miguel?

06:57.760 --> 07:02.080
No, no, no! Why would you do that?! Don't joke…

07:02.320 --> 07:04.288
I'm not joking.

07:04.440 --> 07:05.992
I'm absolutely serious!

07:06.528 --> 07:10.064
Make the preparations, Laios.

07:10.288 --> 07:11.056
Understood.

07:11.472 --> 07:12.720
N-No…!

07:13.200 --> 07:17.056
Skinned alive and stuffed.

07:17.904 --> 07:20.560
I've come to such a faraway land…

07:21.184 --> 07:23.856
And at long last…

07:27.041 --> 07:28.273
I can end this.

07:32.080 --> 07:35.584
Boss, we have an overdue debtor.

07:36.240 --> 07:37.696
The chief of Mintz Village.

07:43.904 --> 07:44.896
I see.

07:45.360 --> 07:48.544
So you intended to repay us,

07:48.544 --> 07:53.360
but this Seeker named Noel
robbed you for all you had.

07:53.712 --> 07:57.728
Yes, precisely! I resisted with all my might!

07:57.728 --> 08:02.688
But he took my wife and daughter hostage
and gouged out my eye!

08:02.688 --> 08:05.632
I had no choice but to give him the money!

08:06.640 --> 08:07.808
Hmm.

08:08.128 --> 08:12.592
And there's more! Noel Stollen said this to me!

08:12.592 --> 08:16.082
"If you have money to give
to the puny Gambino family,

08:16.083 --> 08:19.344
you might as well throw it in
the gutter! I'll take it instead!"

08:20.368 --> 08:22.592
The puny Gambino family, eh?

08:23.480 --> 08:27.776
What a harsh remark. We do our best, after all.

08:28.240 --> 08:32.112
He's smeared the honorable Gambino name!

08:32.112 --> 08:38.960
To prove the family's glory, you must
administer justice to these corrupt Seekers!

08:38.960 --> 08:40.256
Yes, I understand.

08:40.784 --> 08:45.664
Let's administer justice to this Noel Stollen.

08:46.080 --> 08:47.584
I'll wait for the money.

08:47.776 --> 08:50.960
Thank you! Thank you so much!

08:51.392 --> 08:54.896
Now that that's settled,
it's your turn to accept the consequences.

08:55.072 --> 08:55.520
Huh…?

08:56.160 --> 09:01.120
Regardless of the reason,
you went back on your word.

09:01.280 --> 09:04.592
You have to take responsibility for that.

09:04.592 --> 09:07.328
I-I know, but I don't have…

09:07.328 --> 09:08.864
Any money left, yes.

09:09.088 --> 09:10.992
Well, in that case…

09:12.368 --> 09:14.784
I'll take your right arm.

09:15.216 --> 09:19.360
The Seeker took your right eye,
so I'll have your right arm!

09:24.720 --> 09:26.672
Hey. You there.

09:27.600 --> 09:30.368
Your Job is Longswordsman, right?

09:30.368 --> 09:35.248
I hear it's more specialized
in slicing than Swordsmen.

09:38.090 --> 09:41.984
Then cut his arm off for me.

09:42.304 --> 09:43.872
Use that stick.

09:47.744 --> 09:50.144
What are you just sitting there for, Koga?!

09:50.144 --> 09:53.072
Albert gave you an order! Hurry up!

09:54.960 --> 09:56.352
Ah, one moment.

10:06.048 --> 10:08.912
Ahhh! That's the stuff!

10:08.912 --> 10:13.712
I gotta have some of this
before I enjoy some bloodshed!

10:14.624 --> 10:16.480
Great stuff!

10:16.608 --> 10:18.880
Okay, do it. Cut it off!

10:20.320 --> 10:23.616
Heh… He couldn't possibly use that to…

10:39.728 --> 10:44.432
- M-My arm…! My arm!
- Awesome! You did it!

10:44.433 --> 10:45.680
I like you!

10:45.680 --> 10:48.720
You have a good eye, Albert!

10:48.720 --> 10:55.520
This is my gladiator from the easternmost island
who I trained all by myself!

10:55.520 --> 10:59.280
He's a multiple-time champion
in underground fighting!

10:59.824 --> 11:03.486
If you wish, please take him
as a token of our friendship…

11:03.568 --> 11:07.872
Alright! From now on, you're my slave!

11:16.048 --> 11:17.728
Ever since I was born…

11:18.409 --> 11:20.809
I was unwanted by anyone.

11:22.224 --> 11:23.792
My father was a wealthy merchant.

11:24.336 --> 11:26.432
And my mother was said to be a beauty.

11:27.328 --> 11:28.768
They had a blessed life together.

11:29.392 --> 11:33.328
The happy couple only wanted for one more thing.

11:34.832 --> 11:37.056
Please bless us with a child.

11:37.632 --> 11:40.256
An heir to the Tsukishima family.

11:41.536 --> 11:43.600
Nooo!

11:44.112 --> 11:45.072
You…!

11:56.752 --> 11:58.352
Are you hurt?!

12:01.408 --> 12:03.040
I'm sorry, dear.

12:03.984 --> 12:06.144
I'm sorry… I'm sorry…

12:08.848 --> 12:11.904
This caused my mother to fall
into a deep depression.

12:12.592 --> 12:13.392
And then…

12:16.528 --> 12:22.384
Congratulations, sir. It's a boy.
An heir to the Tsukishima family!

12:28.496 --> 12:30.064
There, there.

12:30.784 --> 12:31.808
Dear…

12:32.416 --> 12:34.944
See, Koga? It's your father.

12:37.408 --> 12:38.768
Is that really true?

12:40.416 --> 12:42.784
Is that really my son?

13:06.480 --> 13:10.336
That night, my mother took her own life.

13:11.360 --> 13:12.464
And ever since…

13:20.768 --> 13:23.136
Father! I brought you a drink!

13:25.472 --> 13:30.240
Don't call me your father,
you plague-bringing burden!

13:33.280 --> 13:37.248
What a troublesome parting gift
the lady's left us with.

13:37.792 --> 13:42.000
If only he'd gone with her.

13:42.800 --> 13:45.808
A cursed child that nobody wanted…

13:48.729 --> 13:50.585
That was what I was.

13:51.968 --> 13:54.960
[VI - The Value of Pride]

14:00.736 --> 14:04.176
One morning, I awoke to find myself on a boat.

14:08.113 --> 14:13.025
It wasn't long before I gathered
that I'd been sold as a slave.

14:17.840 --> 14:19.840
Head up, boy.

14:22.816 --> 14:27.392
I'm Miguel. I'm your new master.

14:38.192 --> 14:39.168
Koga!

14:41.608 --> 14:44.840
Good job! Good job, Koga!

14:46.016 --> 14:48.128
You're… praising me?

14:48.197 --> 14:52.192
Whaddya mean? Of course I am! You won!

14:54.336 --> 14:59.968
That was my first time
being praised. Being approved of.

15:01.792 --> 15:03.568
If I just won, then…

15:04.144 --> 15:07.488
Consecutive wins! What a find!

15:07.488 --> 15:11.664
You're my golden goose, Koga!

15:13.568 --> 15:16.512
I see a slave is just a slave in the end.

15:20.064 --> 15:21.488
Are you ready?

15:23.424 --> 15:24.192
Yeah.

15:30.768 --> 15:34.144
Why'd you call me here all of a sudden, Loki?

15:34.880 --> 15:37.616
Well, you've been a valuable customer, boss.

15:38.048 --> 15:39.712
So I'm giving you a freebie.

15:40.704 --> 15:44.320
The Gambino family is out for your head.

15:47.024 --> 15:51.744
So they believed what the chief of
Mintz Village said and are coming after me?

15:52.304 --> 15:56.944
Idiotic. Between that and the drugs,
they can't be in their right minds.

15:57.552 --> 16:02.272
You're right. Their boss Albert Gambino
is a true madman.

16:02.608 --> 16:04.160
He doesn't act on reason.

16:04.768 --> 16:07.296
I heard the old boss was a man of character.

16:07.296 --> 16:09.296
Why did he pass the role on to such a man?

16:09.824 --> 16:12.080
Probably because he only had one son.

16:12.672 --> 16:15.952
Also, I hear Albert was a bastard son
from the previous generation.

16:16.480 --> 16:19.264
He was brought in once he came of age.

16:19.920 --> 16:21.536
So that's the story, huh?

16:22.048 --> 16:23.552
Hmm…? Is that…

16:27.184 --> 16:28.509
That sound…

16:28.656 --> 16:31.104
Someone armed is approaching.

16:31.792 --> 16:32.544
Loki.

16:32.896 --> 16:34.480
You sold me out, didn't you?

16:37.520 --> 16:38.976
Sorry, boss.

16:39.488 --> 16:43.184
Tricking a client as an informant
disqualifies you from being a pro.

16:43.408 --> 16:44.464
I get that.

16:45.008 --> 16:47.152
But I only have one life.

16:47.408 --> 16:49.520
And I got plenty of money, too.

16:49.920 --> 16:54.119
I figure I'll start a new life
in another country after this.

16:54.240 --> 16:58.992
I see. There's one thing you're not
accounting for in that plan, though.

17:01.209 --> 17:04.857
That I have no reason not to kill you.

17:05.705 --> 17:09.449
It's too bad. I didn't hate you.

17:10.824 --> 17:12.904
What a coincidence. I feel the same.

17:14.144 --> 17:16.672
I thought you valued your life.

17:16.968 --> 17:19.432
I do. But now I realize.

17:20.208 --> 17:21.888
It wasn't you that I sold.

17:22.896 --> 17:25.472
It was my pride as an informant.

17:36.480 --> 17:39.408
Go. I'll forget about today.

17:41.056 --> 17:43.792
And you don't have to leave the capital.

17:44.560 --> 17:47.200
I'll destroy the Gambino family personally.

17:48.400 --> 17:51.216
You can gain back your lost pride here.

17:59.024 --> 18:01.439
I always knew you were mad, boss.

18:01.552 --> 18:02.800
Get out of here.

18:02.800 --> 18:04.304
You're in the way of the fight.

18:05.064 --> 18:06.200
I owe you.

18:09.200 --> 18:10.608
A battle potion.

18:11.168 --> 18:12.704
Its effects last ten minutes.

18:13.104 --> 18:16.000
The rebound afterward is strong,
but it boosts my combat power.

18:19.488 --> 18:20.160
He's here.

18:25.104 --> 18:27.504
Are you… Noel Stollen?

18:28.720 --> 18:31.792
Yep. I'm the Seeker you're looking for.

18:32.656 --> 18:35.584
To think you're an assassin for the Gambinos now.

18:36.000 --> 18:38.272
Congrats. You're moving up in the world.

18:38.640 --> 18:41.344
Got yourself a better master than that old man?

18:41.760 --> 18:43.632
None of your business!

18:44.160 --> 18:45.216
Whatever.

18:45.824 --> 18:47.776
We won't be interrupted now.

18:47.992 --> 18:50.520
Let's pick up where we left off.

18:52.841 --> 18:54.057
Why aren't you readying up?

18:55.568 --> 18:58.528
Honestly… I don't wanna fight.

18:58.777 --> 18:59.433
Huh?

19:00.088 --> 19:02.344
I owe you a silver coin.

19:10.400 --> 19:12.480
So you're letting me go?

19:12.752 --> 19:14.864
That's big talk for a leashed dog.

19:15.472 --> 19:18.960
True. I can't disobey my master's orders.

19:19.312 --> 19:21.872
But I have my pride.

19:24.096 --> 19:25.952
I am Koga Tsukishima!

19:25.952 --> 19:27.344
My Job is Longswordsman!

19:27.344 --> 19:30.560
My Rank is C, and my special ability is slicing!

19:30.561 --> 19:32.046
Remember that!

19:34.288 --> 19:39.008
He's spoiling his abilities?
Is that his way of making it a fair fight?

19:39.680 --> 19:41.168
What is he, stupid?

19:42.256 --> 19:43.072
But…

19:44.265 --> 19:47.545
It's only polite to introduce myself in turn.

19:48.048 --> 19:50.384
I'm Talker Noel Stollen!

19:50.944 --> 19:54.032
My special ability is using Skills
without MP cost!

19:54.896 --> 19:59.616
Also, I'm the heir of the great hero Overdeath!

20:00.656 --> 20:01.440
Now!

20:02.016 --> 20:02.640
Here I come!

20:09.360 --> 20:12.576
His speed and accuracy are off the charts now.

20:13.264 --> 20:15.488
Is this his full power?

20:15.928 --> 20:17.350
Flame Bullet!

20:19.696 --> 20:21.040
What?!

20:22.416 --> 20:24.576
I don't know much about Longswordsmen…

20:24.768 --> 20:28.080
But physical frontline Jobs
don't generally have fire resistance.

20:28.752 --> 20:32.144
Even if that can't stop him,
it can damage him significantly.

20:33.136 --> 20:34.080
I win.

20:37.392 --> 20:40.096
An ordinary sword can't cut fire bullets.

20:40.784 --> 20:46.016
Did he just slice the air itself
to create a vacuum?!

21:00.147 --> 21:04.272
Y-You can't go for the crotch!

21:04.272 --> 21:06.272
That's a coward's move!

21:06.512 --> 21:08.060
A coward's move?

21:08.060 --> 21:11.520
Are you dumb? This is a life-or-death fight.

21:11.840 --> 21:15.147
Blinding, biting, kicks to the balls…

21:15.258 --> 21:16.848
Anything goes!

21:17.904 --> 21:19.264
Blinding…?!

21:19.552 --> 21:20.336
Victory is mine.

21:21.984 --> 21:24.704
Dance. Secret Swordsmanship Tsubame Gaeshi!

21:34.416 --> 21:38.080
He fixed an attack in the air
that he could release at any time.

21:38.720 --> 21:41.584
So that's his special ability?

21:43.808 --> 21:44.752
There you are.

21:48.522 --> 21:49.354
Dammit…!

21:49.456 --> 21:50.416
Not yet!

21:50.896 --> 21:52.077
Stop!

21:52.078 --> 21:52.428
[Wolf's Howl]
Stop!

21:55.728 --> 21:56.816
Damn you…

21:59.024 --> 22:00.560
Stun Howl…

22:01.984 --> 22:03.200
…isn't working?!

23:35.040 --> 23:40.070
[VII - Virtueless World]
